        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshihungidi tshia kumudilu mene tshiakadi ne mikenshi ya kulonda mu kutendelela kuabo ne tshitendelelu tshiatshi, tshiakadi tshitendelela tshia ha buloba ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua tshitendelelu tshiakadi tshilongolola; mu muaba watshi wa kumudilu muakadi tshitekelu tshia muinda ne mesa ne mitanda ya mampa yakatekabohu; muaba udibo babikila ne, Wa Tshijila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ku nyima kua tshilulu tshikudika tshibidi kuakadi muaba wa mu tshitendelelu udibo babikila ne, Muaba mutambe tshijila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakadi ne tshioshelu tshia mananashi tshia ngolo, ne mushete wa tshihungidi mulamika ne ngolo ku nseke yonso; munda muau muakadi tshifuadi tshia ngolo tshitekelamu mana, ne mulangala wa Alona wakela ntonga, ne mabue akadi ne mei a tshihungidi mafundahu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne ha mutu hau bakeluba ba butumbi bavuisha dileshi ha mutu ha muaba wa kubuikidila mibi; bua bintu ebi kakuena bualu bua kuamba katataka mudi tshintu ne tshintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi bintu ebi bilongolola nunku, bakuidi badi babuela misangu yonso mu muaba wa kumudilu, benza mudimu wabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi muakuidi munene udi ubuela mu muaba muibidi, yeye nkayandi, musangu umue ku tshidimu ku tshidimu; kena ubuela kai ne mashi adiye ufila bua bualu buandi ne bua matuhakana a bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma Muimpe udi ulesha bualu ebu hatoke ne, Nshila wa ku muaba mutambe wa tshijila kena muanze kuleshibua hatshidi tshitendelelu tshia kumudilu ne mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etshi ntshifuanyikishi tshia ku tshikondo etshi, tshidibo balonda hafilabo bintu bihebua ne milambu mishiha bidi kabi bimanye mua kuyuisha mutendeledi muakane mujalame, mu malu a muoyo-mukese; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua bidi anu mikenshi ya ba ha buloba, mu malu a bia kudia ne bia kunua ne bia kuvua kua mishindu ne mishindu, yakatekabo tô ne ku tshikondo tshia kubilongolola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Kilisto, mumane kulua muakuidi munene wa mu bintu bimpe bilualua, bualu bua tshitendelelu tshitamba bunene ne buakane, katshî tshiasa ne bianza, tshidi bu kuamba ne, Katshiena tshia bifukibua ebi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kembua mashi a mbushi ne a bana ba ngombe, kadi bua mashi andi mene, wakabuela mu muaba mutambe tshijila musangu umue tshiendelele, mumane kuangatshila bantu dihikula dia tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bikala mashi a mbushi ne a balume ba ngombe, ne butue bua muana wa ngombe mukashi bumiamina ha bantu bakunyanguka, bibajidile tô ne ku dilengesha dia mubidi wa ha buloba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mashi a Kilisto, wakadifila kudi Nzambi kai ne ditoba, bua Nyuma wa Tshiendelele, neatambe misangu bungi munyi kulengesha muoyomukese webe ku midimu mifue bua kukuatshila Nzambi udi ne muoyo mudimu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu yeye udi mutuanganyi wa tshihungidi tshihia-tshihia, bua lufu lumane kulua bua dihikula diabo dia ku malu masambuka mikenshi adi munshi mua tshihungidi tshia kumudilu, babo bakubutidibua badi mua kuangata mulabi wa buhianyi bua tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua hikalaku tshihungidi, budibo nʼabu mbua kulesha lufu lua mutshihungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua tshihungidi tshidi ne bukole bikalaku lufu lua muenʼatshi; katshiena ne bukole mu matuku atshidi mutshihungi ne muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, tshihungidi tshia kumudia ka tshiakujadikibua katshî ne mashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua hakambilabo bantu bonso mukenshi wonso kudi Mose, bu mudi mikenshi yamba, wakangata mashi a bana ba ngombe ne a mbushi bohamue ne mai ne miosa mikunze ne hisopa, ne wakamiamina mukanda muine, ne bantu bonso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamba ne, Au adi mashi a tshihungidi tshiakanuelela Nzambi mukenshi bualu buatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamiamina tshitendelelu kabidi ne mashi muomumue, ne bintu bionso biakakuatabo nʼabi mudimu wa kutendelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi mua kuamba ne, Bintu bionso bidi bilengeshibua ne mashi, bu mudi mikenshi yamba, anu bikese bishala, ne bikalaku kakui kumatshisha kua mashi hanshi, kakuena kubuikidila kua mibi nasha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, buakadibo nʼabo mbua kulengesha bifuanyikishi bia bintu bia mu diulu ne bintu abi binakutela; kadi bintu mene bia mu diulu biakalengeshibua ne milambu mihite ei buimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Kilisto kakabuela mu muaba wa tshijila muasa ne bianza, mufuanangane ne muaba mulelela; kadi wakabuela mu diulu muine, bua kumuenekeye mpindiu ku mpala kua Nzambi bua bualu buetu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kena ne bualu bua kudifila ku musangu ne ku musangu, bu mudi muakuidi munene ubuela mu muaba mutambe tshijila ku tshidimu ku tshidimu ne mashi adi kâi andi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyi buakadiye nʼabu mbua kukenga ku musangu ne ku musangu katshia buloba buajadikibua; kadi katataka musangu umue kunshikidilu kua bikondo, wakumueneshibua bua kujimisheye bubi ku kudifila kuandi bu mulambu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua budi busunguila bantu bua kufuabo musangu umue, ne ku nyima kua hualu ebu kulumbulula kudiku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku, Kilisto kabidi, hakafidibueye musangu umue hua kutualeye mibi ya bantu ba bungi, neamueneke musangu muibidi mutahuluke ku bubi, kudi bantu badi bamuindila tô ne ku luhandu luabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
